<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>学生练习：三道递进任务</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#C7D6EE' }}>manhua.py 章节切片教学包</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', padding: '28px 40px', gap: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 9px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>必做</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
        给定 name / selling_point / scene，用 f-string 写出 build_scene_prompt 的函数体，并输出一条完整提示词。
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 9px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>必做</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
        用 for 循环遍历 DEFAULT_SCENES，为一商品批量生成三条场景提示词（巩固第2/3章学的循环）。
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#8B97A8', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#8B97A8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 9px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>选做</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
        把循环封装成 make_all_prompts(name, selling_point)，返回提示词列表，提升代码复用度。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, right: 0, height: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>07 / 09</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
